WEBVTT

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.850
<i>My name is Aoki Reika.</i>

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:08.120
<i>I am president of the student council at this fine school.</i>

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:12.020
<i>I am diligent in my studies,</i>

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:14.820
<i>I never let my gaze stray from my target,</i>

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.590
<i>and once I have determined what must be done, I carry it through to the end.</i>

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:22.280
<i>Such is the path I choose.</i>

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:23.630
Aoki-san!

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:25.800
Miss?

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:26.890
Congratulations!

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:31.040
You've been chosen for the study trip to England!

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:38.550
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:40.420
Smile Precure!

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:41.290
Let's go!

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:42.820
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:43.950
All together!

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:45.560
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.760
Jump to tomorrow!

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:50.430
Smile Precure!

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:55.270
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:00:55.530 --> 00:01:00.740
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:05.910
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:11.840
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:16.720
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:16.720
So bright!

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:21.970
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:28.060
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:28.900
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.060
Let's go!

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:32.650
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:35.690
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:40.490
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:41.070
Girls! Let's go!

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:42.620
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:43.830
Everybody!

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:45.330
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:48.080
Fly to the future!

00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:51.580
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:53.690
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:53.690 --> 00:01:56.060
Smile Precure!

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:05.530
Wait, I've heard of this. Isn't this the program only the best students in the country are chosen for...?

00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:08.430
Yes. She's representing all of Japan!

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:09.900
Wait, what? How...?

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:14.940
Well... I sent in an application when I was in seventh grade, you see.

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:17.240
So... when are you leaving?

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:20.940
In a month. She'll be there for a year, too.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:22.920
In a month...

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:24.250
and for a year...?

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:36.490
Well, that's awesome!

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:38.350
Grats, Reika!

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:39.960
Thank you very much.

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:44.100
I never knew you wanted to study abroad, Reika!

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:47.670
Says a lot ya managed ta make the cut, too!

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:50.370
Still...

00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:56.980
If I were to leave, what would become of the Precure...?

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:03.260
Well, I'm sure we'll cope somehow!

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:05.010
But I...

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:09.990
Besides, we've got a month to worry about that, right? It'll be fine!

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.870
I suppose you're right.

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:18.700
We'll see you tomorrow then, Reika!

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:19.970
Indeed.

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:30.880
To think you'll be studying overseas! We'll have to make sure you're ready!

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:35.270
Ah, yes, I believe I do have a few things tucked away in the closet...

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:36.550
One moment.

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:39.850
Mother, you're getting a little ahead of yourself...

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:47.700
You're really something, Reika. I applied for the same program back in the day, but I didn't get selected.

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:50.570
So... congrats, really.

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:51.880
Make us proud.

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:53.870
I shall.

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:59.280
May I have a moment of your time, Grandfather?

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:06.750
My long-held dream of studying overseas is now coming true.

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:09.080
Well done, child.

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.520
Thank you.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:18.860
Everyone seems so proud of me. My mother, my brother, my teacher and friends...

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:22.730
Truly, it is an honor.

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:32.000
Reika.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:32.870
Yes?

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:38.380
This is the character for "path", is it not?

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:39.580
That it is.

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:41.950
What is this, then?

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:46.350
It also says "path", but it's different...

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:49.460
Different, yes. But they are both paths, nonetheless.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:54.130
Paths may be indirect; they may be winding; they may be unplanned. They come in all kinds.

00:04:54.930 --> 00:05:00.370
What kind of path is being written in the pages of your life, Reika?

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:12.780
<i>I walk along the path I determine, eyes never wavering from my goal.</i>

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:17.990
<i>I have been able to do this thanks to the support of those around me...</i>

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:19.390
<i>But...</i>

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:26.060
<i>what is the path that I must choose...?</i>

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:34.970
My, my. At the very least, they were consistent in their incompetence.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:38.140
It seems I shall have to resort to other methods.

00:05:38.140 --> 00:05:42.210
The Precure may fight as a team of five...

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:47.210
but if I were to eliminate the brains of their operation, Cure Beauty...

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:55.510
Well, I think it deserves testing, no?

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:02.190
What made you want to go abroad, anyway, Reika?

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:09.140
I considered it a good opportunity to broaden my horizons, and see what I was capable of.

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:14.510
My grandfather also said it would be an excellent experience for me to have under my belt.

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:16.850
Well, you've gotta make the most of it, then!

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:18.200
Yup!

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:26.350
You've always been the type to do things for other people, Reika. You know that?

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:34.160
But this is a once-in-a-lifetime chance! You deserve to do your own thing to for once.

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:35.160
Nao...

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:39.370
If you can make your dream come true, then I'll be really happy for you, Reika-kuru!

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:41.900
Yeah, go for it!

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:45.870
Thank you. That means a lot.

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:55.650
This is for the best, isn't it...?

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:56.920
Kuru?

00:06:57.220 --> 00:07:00.520
What's... wrong-kuru?

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:04.360
Why the long faces-kuru...?

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:09.430
I ain't gonna cry... we've gotta see her off with a smile.

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:11.970
What do you mean-kuru?!

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:15.910
Well, you see, Reika-chan's going to be going to a far-off land for a while...

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:19.750
So, we're going to have to say goodbye for a bit.

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.040
Kuru!

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:26.610
I don't want her to go-kuru! I want Reika to stay-kuru!

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:31.720
This isn't about us, Candy. It's about what Reika wants.

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:34.070
You're happy to just let her go-kuru?!

00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:37.860
I don't want her to go-kuru! I don't want her to go-kuru!

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:41.160
<i>No-kuru!</i>

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:56.030
Your shots waver like your heart, my dear.

00:07:57.180 --> 00:07:58.610
Joker?!

00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:02.180
Greetings, Aoki Reika-san.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.020
Now, now!

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:11.390
We'll take this nice and slow.

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:24.510
Look!

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:27.430
Reika-chan!

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:36.550
Welcome to my wonderful world!

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:42.720
Ready?

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:45.990
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:46.970
Go!

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:49.370
Go, go!

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:51.810
Let's Go: Beauty!

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:17.730
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:09:19.150 --> 00:09:20.730
Cure Beauty!

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:26.130
We are impetuous, aren't we?

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:37.580
Congratulations on securing your place abroad!

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:46.610
Beauty!

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:53.580
Beauty!

00:09:56.910 --> 00:09:58.340
What is the meaning of this?

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:04.350
As I said. We're celebrating your upcoming travels. You'll be leaving us soon, will you not?

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:08.390
I'm so wonderfully delighted for you!

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:13.460
I mean, a Precure eliminating herself from our little game is a most welcome development!

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.130
I won't let you take advantage of this!

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:19.960
Oh, my!

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:22.370
You want a farewell duel?

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:25.420
Come forth, Hyper Akanbe!

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:30.610
Hyper Akanbe!

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:36.550
Reika...?!

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:38.360
Where in the world is she?

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:40.420
Let's find her with the Dog Décor-kuru!

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:43.120
Let's Go: Dog!

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:43.860
Woof-kuru!

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:45.680
Sniff sniff...

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:47.260
She's in here-kuru!

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:50.330
Yeah, but how do we...?

00:10:50.970 --> 00:10:53.300
Let's try transforming!

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:55.030
Aka!

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:59.040
Akanbe!

00:10:59.890 --> 00:11:01.870
My, such vigor.

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:06.340
But why bother fighting, if you've no intent to continue as a Precure?

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:09.040
I have every intention of being a Precure!

00:11:09.050 --> 00:11:10.150
Do you now?

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:11.370
Then I take it...

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:16.650
you won't be taking your little trip?

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:21.560
But you had your sights set on it, no?

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:26.360
Are you just going to let this chance slip by?

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:30.100
That would be a shame. But...

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:33.340
it would change my opinion of you quite considerably.

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:34.990
What is that supposed to mean?

00:11:34.990 --> 00:11:36.450
Well...

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:44.110
if you didn't go, you'd be letting down everyone who believed in you, no?

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:48.790
Your friends, your family, your teachers...

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:53.760
They were so thrilled when they heard you were going, weren't they?

00:11:53.760 --> 00:12:00.700
Imagine how disappointed they'll be if you heartlessly turned down your opportunity.

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:03.620
But I, at least, would take delight in your cruelty.

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:04.640
I am not—!

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:08.940
My!

00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:13.010
Your only option, then, must be to go? Or am I mistaken?

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:25.690
{I am twelve and }What is this...?

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:29.160
The right choice. The right future.

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:33.130
You are but who you are, and this is not the choice for others to make.

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:39.100
But they will be delighted for you, of that we can have no doubt.

00:12:39.100 --> 00:12:41.700
So what reason is there to doubt yourself?

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:47.510
Your dream will come true, your friends will be proud, and I for one will be ecstatic!

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:53.150
Everyone's happy! What better outcome could one wish for?

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:58.020
So <i>bon voyage,</i> my dear,

00:12:58.360 --> 00:12:59.420
Cure Beauty.

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:02.490
Oh, how silly of me. You're just Aoki Reika-san now.

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:07.400
Take some time off... you've earned it!

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:12.440
Why...?!

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:14.570
Because this is your decision!

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:21.080
The show's over, the game is up! You are a Precure no longer!

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:28.450
It's curtains for <i>you,</i> Cure Beauty...

00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:32.020
Reika-chan!

00:13:32.720 --> 00:13:34.320
My,

00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:35.560
what a pleasant surprise!

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:38.930
Your friends want to see you off, and I see no reason to decline!

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:41.690
With a bit of luck I can wipe them <i>all</i> out...!

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:52.380
Where are we...?

00:13:53.090 --> 00:13:55.250
Welcome to my show!

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:56.120
Reika!

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:56.780
Reika!

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:04.820
Reika! Why ain't you transformed?!

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:11.230
Come, my dear, tell your friends! They need to know you aren't a Precure anymore!

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:13.130
What do you mean?!

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:17.130
I mean that you've been reduced to a merry little four.

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:20.150
Hyper!

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:21.090
Peace!

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:30.720
Reika! You're still a Precure, right?! He's lying, right-kuru?!

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:34.920
Am I? Then why is she not transformed?

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:40.960
Your friend Reika-san has chosen to disappear to a land far away to pursue her own dream.

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:42.190
Hyper!

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:47.700
Happy!

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:51.870
If you are truly her friends, you should see her off with a smile!

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:55.840
Ya think we don't know that?!

00:14:56.150 --> 00:15:00.040
Of course she has our support! She's our friend!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:04.520
Reika's dream is about to come true...

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:07.810
Yeah, and cause we're her friends...

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:12.920
we've gotta see her off with a smile...

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:17.670
We've gotta smile... gotta smile...

00:15:20.430 --> 00:15:21.570
I'm sorry...

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.340
but I just can't do it...

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:33.310
How can I smile about losing one of my friends?!

00:15:35.630 --> 00:15:38.980
This is killing me inside, damn it!

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:41.950
But if it's what ya want, Reika...

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:44.920
Then we want you to do it!

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:48.580
Reika!

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:49.320
Reika!

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:50.700
Reika-chan...!

00:15:56.170 --> 00:15:58.270
No!

00:15:58.270 --> 00:15:59.940
No-kuru!

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:09.930
I don't want to go...

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:15.950
Reika-chan...?

00:16:16.760 --> 00:16:20.340
I don't want to leave you either!

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:28.030
I don't want to leave you either!

00:16:28.030 --> 00:16:30.470
I want to stay here with you all!

00:16:31.270 --> 00:16:38.110
The very thought of being kept apart from you all... I couldn't... I couldn't bear it!

00:16:38.110 --> 00:16:38.960
Reika!

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:39.480
Reika!

00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:40.100
Reika-chan!

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:41.060
Reika-chan!

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:42.800
Reika...!

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:44.720
Candy!

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:02.420
My, such delightful disgrace!

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:06.990
Very well! If you yearn for each other's company so, I shall dispatch you all together!

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:09.040
Hy! Hy-hy-hy-hy-hy!

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:10.740
Stop right there.

00:17:12.390 --> 00:17:13.180
Reika?

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:14.280
Kuru?

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:19.120
Does little miss Ex-Precure have something to contribute from the peanut gallery?

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:25.320
Remind me when I stated I was quitting as a Precure?

00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:27.640
Because as I recall...

00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:28.960
...I said no such thing!

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:38.390
My name is Aoki Reika!

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:39.700
But you know me as...

00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:46.040
Cure Beauty!

00:17:51.650 --> 00:17:52.620
Beauty...

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:57.190
Are you kidding me?!

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:04.700
Excuse my lateness.

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:13.640
Why do you still choose to fight?!

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:17.480
You should live up to your expectations and study abroad like a good girl!

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:21.860
Such may be your thinking...

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:26.790
but it is not my answer!

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:32.320
Then you'd give up on your dream, and betray those who care for you?!

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:35.660
That's hardly like you!

00:18:42.190 --> 00:18:45.020
Have you lost sight of your path?!

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:48.700
No! I have only just found it!

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:54.810
Paths may be indirect...

00:18:55.390 --> 00:18:56.250
They may be winding...

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:57.750
They may be unplanned...!

00:18:58.360 --> 00:19:00.750
Yet they are all paths nonetheless!

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:24.210
I shall walk my own path.

00:19:24.550 --> 00:19:27.250
And there are none who can decide that path but I!

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:38.120
It may not be the quickest road to where I wish to be...

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:41.930
but I shall be true to myself...

00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:45.830
My feelings, my desires...

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:48.730
My path!

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:57.040
What?!

00:19:57.310 --> 00:20:02.520
Precure... Beauty Blizzard... Arrow!!

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:19.700
Wow, Beauty...

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:21.300
My friends...

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:26.140
the time has come.

00:20:26.400 --> 00:20:27.510
Right!

00:20:29.150 --> 00:20:31.850
Reveal your secrets, Royal Clock!

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:35.220
Combine our powers together-kuru!

00:20:39.970 --> 00:20:43.020
May the light of hope shine!

00:20:43.810 --> 00:20:47.280
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:20:48.250 --> 00:20:49.240
Precure...

00:20:50.070 --> 00:20:53.220
Royal Rainbow...

00:20:53.430 --> 00:20:55.970
Burst!

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:03.960
Akanbe....!

00:21:06.810 --> 00:21:10.380
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:17.020
That's another new Décor-kuru!

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:19.980
Cure Beauty...!

00:21:25.670 --> 00:21:28.160
So you aren't gonna go after all...?

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:29.040
Correct.

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:31.140
But you won't get another chance!

00:21:31.150 --> 00:21:33.010
Most likely not.

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:34.940
But...

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:38.710
I wish to remain here.

00:21:39.030 --> 00:21:44.150
The time I can spend with you all is far more valuable to me.

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:48.890
Reika!!

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:55.530
<i>My name is Aoki Reika.</i>

00:21:55.960 --> 00:22:00.460
<i>I walk my path with determination — and with my dear friends by my side!</i>

00:22:01.270 --> 00:22:04.320
<i>Such is the path I choose.</i>

00:23:39.110 --> 00:23:44.050
I was a really shy girl when I was young... I never did have many friends.

00:23:44.050 --> 00:23:44.840
Seriously, Miyuki?

00:23:44.840 --> 00:23:45.500
Really?

00:23:45.500 --> 00:23:46.420
That's unexpected.

00:23:46.420 --> 00:23:48.280
I can relate, though.

00:23:48.280 --> 00:23:51.990
But I did have this one friend who taught me the importance of smiling...

00:23:51.990 --> 00:23:56.560
and that's what made me want to find ultra happiness!

00:23:57.120 --> 00:23:58.460
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:04.520
Find your ultra happy smile!
